"help.assist.title" = "Helping hand";
"help.assist.body" = "If you barely miss the edge of a girder, the game gently pulls you onto it. Hit a wall fast while in the air and your character flips and rises, steered toward the highest girder it can reach; use it to build combos. You get at most 10 flips before landing on a girder; after that the wall only bounces you back. Landing on a girder resets the count.";
"help.bubbles.title" = "Surprise bubbles";
"help.bubbles.body" = "Bubbles float above some girders; pass through one to take it. The rocket flies you 50 floors up. Slow motion slows the world for 6 seconds. Adrenaline makes you run faster and jump higher for 8 seconds. The shield protects you from the burning film for 10 seconds. Active effects and their remaining time show at the top of the screen.";
"help.respawn.title" = "One more chance";
"help.respawn.body" = "Once per game, when the burning film catches you, you come back for free: you return to the last girder you stood on, the film pulls back, and you get a 3-second shield. If it catches you again, the game ends.";
"help.characters.title" = "Characters";
"help.characters.body" = "Every trophy you win is saved as a cup to spend. Use the Characters button on the title screen to unlock four new characters: Peanut (1), Meowly (2), Gentleman (3), Propeller (5). Characters only change the look, not the gameplay.";

